    "opening": "Small-business inventory management tracks what stock exists, where it is, whether it can be sold and what purchasing will commit in cash. A reliable routine reconciles movements to physical counts before turning the balance into buying decisions.",
    "answerHtml": "<p>Small-business inventory management tracks what stock exists, where it is, whether it can be sold and what purchasing will commit in cash. A reliable routine reconciles movements to physical counts before turning the balance into buying decisions.</p>",
    "answerTitle": "Quick answer",
